; Compare real low-priority application progress under the original ROM driver
; and the production MCDevice driver on the same target in one boot.
FailAt 21
MakeDir RAM:T
Assign T: RAM:T
Echo "Measuring original mtecscsi.device CPU availability (read-only)."
MCCpuBench DEVICE mtecscsi.device UNIT 1 SECONDS 3 READSIZE 524288 LOG RAM:cpu-mtec.log
Type RAM:cpu-mtec.log >DF0:cpu-mtec.log
Echo "Replacing the original driver with production MCDevice."
MCDiag TAKEOVER LOADONLY
Echo "Measuring production mastercard.device CPU availability (read-only)."
MCCpuBench DEVICE mastercard.device UNIT 1 SECONDS 3 READSIZE 524288 LOG RAM:cpu-mcdevice.log
Type RAM:cpu-mcdevice.log >DF0:cpu-mcdevice.log
Echo "Done. Results: DF0:cpu-mtec.log and DF0:cpu-mcdevice.log"
